@startuml transformpath-queue
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Apple SD Gothic Neo"
skinparam defaultFontSize 15
skinparam ArrowColor #496A88
skinparam Padding 6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EEF5FB
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #496A88
skinparam sequenceLifeLineBorderColor #496A88
hide footbox
title Queue 등록과 프레임 계산

participant QueuedPathFollower as Queue
participant PathQueueSession as Session
participant QueuedPathManager as Manager
participant PathFollower as Follower

== 시작 ==
Queue -> Follower : StartPreparedPlayback
Queue -> Session : TryAcquire
Session -> Manager : Register
Manager --> Session : PathQueueRegistration
Session -> Follower : AttachQueueConstraint
note right of Follower : 첫 결과가 올 때까지 대기

== 매 프레임 ==
Manager -> Manager : 진행도 복사와 정렬\n앞 Agent부터 간격 계산
Manager -> Queue : ApplyQueueState
Queue -> Follower : ApplyQueueConstraint
note right of Follower : 다른 경로 버전이나\n이전 프레임의 결과는 버림
Queue -> Session : Step\n대기, 재출발 지연, 속도 완화
Queue -> Follower : ApplyQueueConstraint
Follower -> Follower : 제약 안에서 이동

== 끝 ==
Queue -> Session : Release(사유)
Session -> Manager : Unregister
Manager -> Queue : OnQueueDetached
@enduml
